# A key written on the header line.
-- input.cnf --
[mydumper]
[myloader] threads=4
-- diagnostics --
2:1-2:21 error MDL106[invalid-group-line] unexpected text after the group header: `threads=4`; GLib only allows spaces after `]` (GLib: Invalid key name: [myloader] threads)
  = mydumper ignores this entire file: it only logs a WARNING ("Failed to load config file") and runs with its defaults, exit code 0.
